      },
      "feedback": {
        "correct": "$f(2) = 8 + 8 - 10 + 1 = 7$.",
        "generic": "Not quite right. By the remainder theorem, work out $f(2)$.",
        "byKey": {
          "minus-two": "You worked out $f(-2) = 11$. Dividing by $(x - 2)$ tests $x = 2$.",
          "constant": "1 is the constant term, the remainder on dividing by $x$. Use $f(2)$."
